# Excavator.Mastodon · In-Game MDK2 Script Project

## Subsystem: MASTODON-01 Expeditionary Mining Locomotive & Genesis Seed Mothership
* **Target Blocks:**
  * `[MAS] PB Excavator` (Machine Kinematics, Outriggers, 5-DOF Boom Macros · Update1)
  * `[MAS] PB RIG//OS-Lite` (Fleet Mothership C2, Asset Registry, Ground Base Handover · Update10)
* **Grid Size:** Large Grid Consist (11 × 42 × 7 B · 10 Wheels · 2 Carriages)
* **Update Frequency:** `Update1` (Kinematics) / `Update10` (Fleet C2)
* **Managed Subsystem Groups:** `MAS STAB, MAS BOOM, MAS TOOL, MAS WHEEL, MAS HITCH, MAS COMM, MAS HOLD, MAS MP, MAS DUMP, MAS POWER, MAS REFINERY, MAS BATTERY, MAS DOORS, MAS TURRETS, MAS WELDERS, MAS LIGHTS, MAS SEISMIC, MAS CLAMP, MAS DECOY, MAS AIRLOCK, MAS LIFE, MAS SCUTTLE, MAS BP, MAS PROJECTOR, MAS HITCH CLAMPS, MAS OUTRIGGERS UTILITY, MAS DPU, MAS FOB, MAS MULTITOOL, MAS RESUPPLY, MAS ARMORY, MAS AIRLOCKS, MAS DECON, MAS VENTS CABIN, MAS VENTS AIRLOCK, MAS MUNITIONS`
* **IGC Network Channels:**
  * Network C2: `RIG.C2.HEARTBEAT, RIG.C2.HANDOVER`
  * Logistics Outbound: `TMS.MULE.CALL, TMS.CAT.CALL, TMS.MAS.STATUS, TMS.LOGISTICS.JIT, TMS.CONVOY.SYNC`
  * Consist & Powertrain Bus: `TMS.CONSIST.SYNC, TMS.CONSIST.TRACTION, TMS.CONSIST.SEVER`
  * Resupply Bus: `TMS.RESUPPLY.REQUEST, TMS.RESUPPLY.OFFER, TMS.RESUPPLY.DISPATCH, TMS.RESUPPLY.COMPLETE`
  * Environmental & Airlock Bus: `TMS.ENV.MODE, TMS.AIRLOCK.CYCLE`
  * Meteor & Ammo Bus: `TMS.METEOR.ALERT, TMS.AMMO.STATUS`
  * Inbound Fleet Bus: `TMS.SCOUT.VEIN, TMS.CAT.STATUS, FLT.MAS.CMD, TMS.BASE.DEMAND`
  * Swarm & Defense Mesh: `TMS.SCOUT.TASK, TMS.SEISMIC.SURVEY, TMS.ZONE.CLAIM, TMS.DEFENSE.TARGET`

## System Description
Controls the MASTODON-01 MKI expeditionary consist and regional fleet orchestration:
1. **Machine Kinematics (`PB Excavator`):** 4× hydraulic bedrock outriggers with automated voxel lock verification, 5-DOF articulated boom inverse kinematics supporting 4 automated sweep and crane macros (Bench Quarry, Vertical Shaft Bore, Trench & Road Carve, Crane Recovery & Hoisting), 2-axis motorized drawbar dampening, and multi-axle counter-steering.
2. **Fleet Mothership Hub (`PB RIG//OS-Lite`):** Regional C2 authority coordinator in survival campaigns prior to Ground Base refinery commissioning. Coordinates subordinate worker excavators (`MAS-02`), dispatches Caterpillar land trains (`CAT-01`) and Mule shuttles (`MUL-01`), tracks ore quotas, and executes seamless dynamic handover to `GND-01` upon Ground Base commissioning.
3. **Tri-Fuel Power & Field Metallurgy Supervision:** Real-time fuel telemetry across Tier 1 Nuclear (2× Small Reactors), Tier 2 Renewable (4× Solar Panels), and Tier 3 Emergency Hydrogen (1× H2 Engine). Supervised closed-loop field metallurgy (`MAS Field Refinery` + `MAS Utility Assembler`) and automated ice replenishment routing.
4. **Hybrid Energy Storage & 5-Mode Management:** Monitors 18.0 MWh battery bank (6× Large Batteries) and sequences 5 operational energy modes: Silent Watchkeeping (Eco), Tractive Cruise, Heavy Excavation, Emergency Failover, and Shore Power Fast Recharge.
5. **Perimeter Defense CIWS & Warfare 3 Baseline:** Coordinates 360° defensive perimeter across 2× Gatling Turrets (`MAS Turret Bow / Stern`) and 2× flank anti-personnel turrets. Integrates automated `RIG.OS.MODE CBT` alert sequencing upon hostile target acquisition or hull damage. Serves as pre-Warfare 3 baseline with architectural upgrade path to MASTODON-02 MKII upon Warfare 3 DLC release.
6. **Expeditionary Logistics & Crane Grapple (Decision 62):** Automated outrigger seismic prospecting (`TMS.SCOUT.VEIN`), flight deck recessed drone repair welders (`MAS Welder Pad Kestrel 1, 2`), 45 m boom crane grapple mode (`MACRO_CRANE`), free ambient planetary O2 scavenging, and worksite 360° floodlight matrix.
7. **Extraction Arm Travel Stow & Target-Centric Vertical Column Bore (Decision 63):** 14-block straight spine stow along dorsal trough (`STOW` / `DEPLOY`) locking into `MAS Clamp Boom Stow` (`[X0, Z -7, L4]`) at 5.2 m transit height. Centerline mounting provides symmetrical 21.25 m physical flank reach beyond tires. 90° downward elbow tool adapter locks drills in true vertical orientation `[0, -1, 0]` across 6.0 m to 35.0 m reach envelope. Target-centric column bore macro (`BORE <GPS>`) executes 2D lateral translation and plunge centered on target vein coordinates.
8. **Custom Walk-In Bridge, ULSS & Emergency Survivability Suite (Decision 64):** Replaces cockpit with custom walk-in bridge (3× 1×1×1 control stations at L4, panoramic glass canopy, 3-page hotbars). Universal life support (ULSS) with 200,000 L O2 bank, quarantined 15,000 L ice hold, 2× cryo pods, and 4-zone hermetic isolation. Native block failsafes (Rule C4): 3× armored decoys, pyrotechnic hitch severing merge block (`HITCH DECOUPLE`), 2× keel recovery gyros, armored black box 50 km SOS beacon, Genesis self-repair projector, 2× anti-capture scuttle warheads (60 s countdown loop), and 6× in-situ Sci-Fi 4-Button Panels.
9. **Tri-Mode Multitool Salvage & Remote Welding Suite (Decision 65):** ToolCore tri-mode operation across Mining (Drill), Salvage (Grinder / 15-30 m standoff deconstruction with 100% component retention), and Fabrication (Welder / 35 m remote engineering). Macro 5 Wreck Deconstruction (`MACRO_SALVAGE`) executes automated planar raster sweeps (ΔY, ΔX) across target structures. Supervised closed-loop recycling circuit routing components to `MAS Hold Components`, scrap metal to `MAS Field Refinery`, and surplus disassembly in `MAS Utility Assembler`.
10. **Multi-Tier Fleet Comms, Predictive JIT Logistics & Swarm Synergy (Decision 66):** Real-time mass tracking (ΔMass / Δt) pre-dispatches transports at 75-80% capacity (`TMS.LOGISTICS.JIT`). Dual-tier logistics triage (roof Mule pad vs stern Caterpillar dump). Directed scout tasking (`TMS.SCOUT.TASK`), acoustic subsurface pulse telemetry (`TMS.SEISMIC.SURVEY`), aerial IGC relay mesh over Kestrel, pull-based demand mining (`TMS.BASE.DEMAND`), multi-consist quarry exclusion zones (`TMS.ZONE.CLAIM`), and synchronized fleet CIWS targeting (`TMS.DEFENSE.TARGET`).
11. **Consist Mechanics, DPU Traction & FOB Autonomy (Decision 67):** 3-axis heavy gimbal hitch (Yaw ±45°, Pitch ±25°, Roll ±20°) with twin magnetic anti-oscillation clamps (`MAS Hitch Clamp Port/Stbd`). Distributed Power Unit (DPU) smart traction on Axles 4 and 5 matching climb torque, with predictive regenerative descent braking keeping the drawbar in tension. Autonomous FOB detachment ("Drop-and-Mine") allowing Carriage 2 to function as an independent stationary base via `[MAS-U] PB Utility` and `MAS-U Remote FOB`, protected by runaway breakaway deadman brakes (`MAS-U EC Breakaway` + 2× keel ground skids). Twin stern outriggers (`MAS Outrigger Utility Port/Stbd`) isolating 650 t Mule landing impacts and establishing a 42 m seismic baseline. Telescoping soft-capture docking tongue (`MAS Piston Stern Dock`, 2.5 m stroke) for Caterpillar coupling, and relocated stern tailings aggregate roadbed discharge manifold.
12. **4× Multitool Repair Turrets, SML Auto-Production & Peer Resupply Sorties (Decision 68):** 4× Large Grid Multitool Turrets (Simple Laser Multitools Mod 3175774286 / ToolCore 3040438530) positioned at Bow L5, Port/Stbd shoulders L4, and Stern elevated arch L7 for 360° self-repair and service of docked Kestrel and Mule drones without EVA. Standard Mission Loadout (SML) inventory quota tracking in `MAS Hold Components` with autonomous production delta queuing in `MAS Utility Assembler`. Dedicated outbound staging hopper `MAS Hold Resupply Export` and sorter `MAS Sorter Resupply Export` for rapid top-deck Mule peer resupply transfer (< 10 s) executing standardized mission kits (`KIT_MOBILITY`, `KIT_POWER`, `KIT_MUNITIONS`, `KIT_HULL_REPAIR`) over IGC channels `TMS.RESUPPLY.*`.
13. **Extended Survival Life Support, Decon Airlocks & Environmental Hardening (Decision 69):** 2× Armory Lockers (`MAS Armory Bridge`, `MAS Armory Workshop`) and 1× Equipment Locker (`MAS Locker Survival Gear`) pre-stocked with Tier 4 tools, rifles, ammo, and suit bottles. Dedicated suit recharge stations at Bridge and Workshop for zero-downtime pilot turnaround. Airtight 4-zone hermetic cabin circulation with dual-mode planetary atmospheric scavenging (`MAS EC Atmosphere Mode`: ambient Earth-like O2 scavenging vs vacuum/toxic 100% closed-loop recirculation). True dual-door gas-reclamation airlocks with active depressurization vents, cyan UV decontamination lighting, and interlock cycling across all 4 consist egress points (Port Boarding, Inter-Carriage Gangway, Flight Deck Roof, Stern Dump). Non-Earthlike environmental hardening: Faraday lightning diverter mast (`MAS Decoy Mast` [X0, Z +6, L6]) safely grounding Pertam/Alien lightning strikes away from bridge glass and H2 tanks, toxic air sensor shutoff, 330 kW refinery reject heat thermal trace jacketing `MAS Hold Ice LifeSupport` against cryogenic freezing on Europa/Triton, radiation storm citadel shelter between twin 4.5 m liquid H2 tanks, and hardwired CIWS automated meteor intercept (`Target Meteors = ON`). Total consist: 1,123 blocks (+13 blocks), dry mass ≈ 1,150.7 t, 9,880 PCU.
14. **Automated Meteor Defense Grid, Closed-Loop Ammo Fabrication & Dynamic Restock (Decision 70):** 360° hemispherical CIWS intercept dome via dual Large Grid Gatling Turrets (`MAS Turret Bow / Stern`) and flank Interior Turrets configured with `Target Meteors = ON`. Target lock via `MAS EC Meteor` triggers high-decibel early warning siren `MAS Alarm Meteor` ([X0, Z +8, L4]) and automated consist hardening sequence (emergency boom stow `STOW` into armored dorsal spine trough, boarding ladder auto-retraction, airlock outer door lock, and drone magnetic clamp lockdown to isolate kinetic shock). Autonomous closed-loop munitions manufacturing monitoring SML quotas (250× NATO 25×184mm ammo boxes, 100× NATO 5.56×45mm magazines) via `MAS EC Ammo`; auto-queues ammo fabrication in `MAS Utility Assembler` at highest combat priority from refined Magnesium, Iron, and Nickel ingots when stock < 60%. Hardened sub-floor ammo bunker `MAS Hold Munitions` ([X0, Z −15, L2]) isolated by 40× heavy steel ballast plates against sympathetic detonation. High-speed conveyor sorter `MAS Sorter Ammo Fwd` with whitelist and `Drain All = ON` pressurizing forward CIWS feeds. Automated external restock: if local Mg < 50 kg or ammo < 25%, broadcasts `TMS.RESUPPLY.REQUEST;MAS-01;KIT_MUNITIONS` for rapid Mule top-deck pallet delivery (< 10 s). Total consist: 1,126 blocks (+3 blocks), dry mass ≈ 1,151.8 t, 10,015 PCU.

## Zero-GC PB Rules
1. C# 6 only, nested in Program, namespace `IngameScript`.
2. Zero allocations in hot paths (`Main`, `Update1`, `Update10`, `Update100`).
3. Strings formatted via `SbFormat`.
4. Strict grid scoping: `b => b.CubeGrid == Me.CubeGrid`.
5. Minifier safe: never use `enum.ToString()` or `nameof()`.


